					<p data-i18n-id="Fakta sudut, bearing, pengukuran, titik tengah, pembagi sudut dan garis, serta konstruksi segitiga." data-i18n-en="Angle facts, bearings, measurement, midpoint, angle and line bisectors, and triangle construction.">Fakta sudut, bearing, pengukuran, titik tengah, pembagi sudut dan garis, serta konstruksi segitiga.</p>
					<div class="unit-strand">Algebra, Geometry and Measure</div>
					<div class="topic-list">
								<a class="topic-card" href="/e-learning/coming-soon?subject=cambridge-stage-8-angles-bearings-and-measure">
									<span class="topic-kicker">Topic 1</span>
