								</a>
								<a class="topic-card" href="/e-learning/coming-soon?subject=cambridge-stage-8-functions">
									<span class="topic-kicker">Topic 2</span>
									<strong>Functions</strong>
									<small data-i18n-id="Buka lesson" data-i18n-en="Open lesson">Buka lesson</small>
								</a>
								<a class="topic-card" href="/e-learning/coming-soon?subject=cambridge-stage-8-graphs-and-equation-of-a-straight-line">
									<span class="topic-kicker">Topic 3</span>
